Why this directory is MIT while the rest of the installer is proprietary
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Senternal deliberately releases this password driver under MIT as project
policy. This directory's explicit grant prevents the installer's proprietary
LICENSE.md from being mistaken for the driver's license. Keep the MIT grant
and copyright notice intact when redistributing or maintaining this driver.

Roundcube is GPL-3.0-or-later with an exception for qualifying plugins and skins
that merely call Roundcube and include it by reference. That exception permits
other licenses; running in-process alone does not require a GPL-compatible
plugin license. See https://roundcube.net/license/ . The exception does not
automatically cover copied core code, core modifications or other GPL hosts.
This driver uses the documented plugins/password/drivers/ extension point and
does not patch Roundcube. Roundcube and other components retain their respective
licenses; this MIT grant applies to this driver, not to Roundcube itself.
